{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_lionhd_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_lionhd_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Living in Darkness",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lionhd_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0cc866e0a12848fab70745e09cd703e12512d654d8ad1a1f2d8374653074cf0e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Negative in zones E31 and E32. Possible positive in zone 30...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Hey, are you okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "I'm fine, just a little dizzy...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Miner",
      "text": "Let me guess, fatigue?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Miner",
      "text": "That bloody Cowell thinks we're burdenbeasts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Miner",
      "text": "There are so many of us here. We should be burying our pickaxes in his skull, not these rocks!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Shh! Not so loud. His men are nearby.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Who knows what they might do if they hear you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Yeah, it's okay... don't worry about me. I can take it...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Let me handle it. You take a break, see if Leonhardt needs anything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Miner",
      "text": "That Catastrophe Messenger has it easy!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Miner",
      "text": "It's his fault that we got kidnapped and taken here in the first place!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "Hey! What are you doing? Slacking off?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "But what? Know your place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "You're hostages!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey now, take it easy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Put yourself in his shoes. What's left of them, anyway...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Imagine if you were a miner who got packed into a crate like ore, dragged to this dangerous Catastrophe zone, and made to bang on rocks without rest.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "It's exhausting just thinking about it, am I right? Like, just saying it made me feel so tired I can hardly talk anymore...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So why not let them have a little break, my good man? I'm sure they'll work even harder afterwards.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Or, say, maybe we could do it this way. I'll go look for veins, and if I find something, we could get the miners to—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "That's enough out of you, brat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "There's only a small window when the veins are exposed after a Catastrophe. Timing is everything in the competition for mining rights.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "Don't think I don't know what you're thinking. You want to sit on your thumbs until Maize Drill sends a rescue and steals what we know about the veins!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Wait, wasn't it Cowell who kidnapped you all? Why would the miners blame <i>you</i>?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Eh, learning to deal with people getting upset is like Catastrophe Messenger 101.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "And hey, I couldn't persuade the guards, so... I get it. Perfectly understandable.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "But hadn't you been helping them, mate?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Well, not for very long, I hadn't... Maybe they'd have listened to Cruise Jr.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Hey, now there's a familiar name.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Wasn't he the one who sent you a thank-you letter? The one you read to us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Oh? Ahaha... did I read his letter to you guys?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "You did. I remember.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Ah... I thought I only read it to the girls at Medical...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Well, it wasn't just his letter. There were many others. I can see how you'd forget which ones you'd read.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "So, why do you keep bringing up this Cruise Jr.? Was he the real culprit behind the scenes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Hm? That can't be right. He sounded to me like the kinda guy you can count on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "In terms of narrative, someone in his position isn't necessarily the antagonist. He could also have a positive influence on the protagonist's actions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "All we can infer from what we know is that he played an important role in this event.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, what's with all this attention on Cruise Jr.? This is about MY heroic exploits!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, is that... Ayers!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Ayers! Over here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Stop shouting, Leon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "I knew you were here. I could hear you babbling about your 'heroic exploits' from the cafeteria entrance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Cowell would have cut your head off if you were half as noisy when you were kidnapped.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Cowell? Wait, so the story is true?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "...Parts of it, maybe? I haven't heard this version yet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "You can take my seat then. I need to return a book to Sonya.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Well then, Kroos and I will also...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, don't go! I'm not finished!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "What do you need, sir?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Huh? Ah, just hold these for me. You can sit down over there, take a break. Oh, and check if there are any notable cracks on the walls while you're at it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Take a break? So you overheard us talking...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Yeah, I did. No need to worry about my feelings though, we Catastrophe Messengers are tougher than we look. Mm-hmm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "If Cowell's men ask, I made you do this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So take a break. Keep that up, and your lungs will only get worse.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Thank you, sir.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "All my years of hardship would it worth it, if the young folks of Rim Billiton all grow up like you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "And Ayerscarpe... he can be aloof, but there's something about him that's different from the other guards.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "When I fell behind earlier... he saw through how sick I was and helped me carry my stuff.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "My lungs have been giving out for a few years now, but mining is the only thing I know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "I haven't told anyone except Cruise Jr. Didn't want to be seen as useless.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Well... Ayers and I grew up together on a mining ship.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So how should I put it...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "I managed to grab this before Cowell burned our camp. Have you seen it before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "This is... did it belong to Ayerscarpe?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Yeah, he puts his edamame inside.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Edamame?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hilarious, isn't it? He looks so tough, but he has such a soft spot for the stuff.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "When we were little, we knew an old man around the mines who had a lung disease.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "He sold snacks next to the mine because he couldn't go in anymore. Grease and smoke were too much for him too, so he made stuff like salt-boiled edamame.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "And he always gave kids like us extra.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Only when we grew up did we learn how little he made.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So for me and Ayers, miners are kind of like family... well, close neighbors, at least.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Leonhardt...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "L-Leonhardt! Are you there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hm? What's wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Cowell's men are taking Luca away! Cruise is trying to stop them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Wait, there's a new character? Who's this Luca?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "It's gotta be that 'Angry Miner' guy from before, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Oh, you mean the guards overheard the miners talking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Well, I don't know the full picture... All I know is that Cowell's men had Cruise Jr. surrounded and were beating him up when I arrived.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Because he wouldn't let them take Luca away?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Cowell wanted to make an example of him. Show what happens to people who speak up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "Thank you for saving me... even after all I said about you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "No worries. Cowell wouldn't exactly refuse to trade a miner for a new ore deposit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Cruise Jr. is the one you should thank. He put himself on the line for you, against so many burly guys too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "You're right...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "So... how is he?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Still out cold.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "He has a broken arm and quite a few bumps and bruises, but no harm to any vital organs, fortunately.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "Damn it... that bastard Cowell and his goons...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Please, Luca! Just keep your head down, and we might see daylight again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Get on Cowell's bad side, and we're all dead men walking!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "I heard Cowell has a female bodyguard...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Former assassin. Real nasty stuff... There was a young entrepreneur who got into a bidding war with him at an auction.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "The bodyguard cut the guy's arms off. In front of everyone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Why would someone like that take orders from a man like Cowell?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Apparently, she has friends and family working for Cowell Mining... He must be holding them hostage.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "He's pretty paranoid and likes to keep a firm grasp on his subordinates. The mine guards are probably the same.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "But I haven't seen any female subordinates around him... strange.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "...Maybe she's watching us from the shadows.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "I would've said you were full of shit, if I hadn't seen Ayerscarpe in action.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Luca",
      "text": "After seeing him fight a whole regiment, though... I wouldn't be surprised if Cowell had someone like that under his command.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "text": "Who knows which of 'em would have the upper hand if they came face-to-face... but I'm guessing a former assassin knows some dirty tricks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "You give me too little credit, Leon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "But that's checkmate isn't it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "If it's someone not even Ayerscarpe can handle...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Wouldn't you be stuck in that mine at Cowell's mercy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Let's see how the protagonist gets out of <i>this</i> predicament.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Well, that's not the important part... the bodyguard was a ghost who never even appeared. But I made an even more shocking discovery in the mines...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "What was it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Explosives.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Cowell was waiting for Maize Drill to send rescue, then he'd blow us all up together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Maybe you could have dealt with the guards, Ayers, but could you stop an explosion?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Tch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Er...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "This is getting a little scary...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Zzz... zzz...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Kroos...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Kroos?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "She dozed off.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Let her sleep. I feel it's going to be a while before we get to the good part.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, are you implying that wasn't a good part?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "An unarmed miner, bravely making a stand against the evil mine owner and his hired muscle!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Inspired by his act of courage, the Catastrophe Messenger heads towards a showdown with the villain!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "(Yawns)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Did you just... yawn at me? I sure hope that was the fun kind of yawn.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Oh, sorry, couldn't resist... I must have eaten a little too much...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Ha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Let them off the hook, Leon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Isn't tormenting me enough?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "So, how did you propose to deal with the explosives, Leonhardt?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "He caused a massive explosion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, spoilers! We're not there yet! Good storytelling is about the journey!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So, this is where the detonation switch should be...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Number 26. Any more in this area...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Leonhardt...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Oh, you're awake! Does it hurt anywhere?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "I'm much better. It's just the arm... There's no need to do all this for me, Leonhardt.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Stay put. You have a broken forearm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "...What're those?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Oh? Well... these are transmitters I use to detect Catastrophe movement.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "I used to be an engineer in the army. Those are explosives, aren't they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Did Cowell do this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Most likely. There must be seventy, eighty bundles in this hole. Enough to flip this entire place upside down, and us along with it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Good thing they're not the type that explode on contact...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "I can help. I've defused explosives before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Not with that arm you can't. There are better ways to be a tough guy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Look.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "...Originium Arts?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "I can't believe you destroyed the detonators with such precision from such a distance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Completely undetectable, too. No alarms raised.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "But it's all over if they see you fiddling around down here and decide to press the BOOM button.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Head back and join up with the rest. The company will send rescue soon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Leonhardt...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Will the company really send help?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Most of us are on short-term contracts with Maize Drill.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "No one expected this, the whole Catastrophe and vicious competition between corporations...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "To tell you the truth, though... most of us in this group are still owed wages.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "The workers disappear, no more wages owed, there's evidence implicating a competitor...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Wouldn't that be rather convenient for the higher ups?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "No worries, you're talking to a super experienced Catastrophe Messenger here! I'll find a way to get you home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Listen, Cruise. I've got a plan, but I need your help.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "The guards still think you're out cold, so you're the best man for the job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "W-What is it? I'll do whatever I can.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Do you remember the way in?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "I'll create a diversion while you go back the way we came.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Wait for Ayers at the entrance. He'll help you get out of here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "And... give him this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cruise Jr.",
      "text": "Your clothes? There's blood on them... are you hurt?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Just a little scratch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Pass on a message, too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "'Stay away, Ayers. Forget the contract. Leave this to me.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Honestly, I find it hard to picture those words coming out of your mouth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, I got all the miners out safely! I'm not all talk, I've got the receipts!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "So, about the explosion...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Heh, now <i>that</i> was my genius plan!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "I overheard the guards say that Cowell kidnapped me because his Catastrophe Messenger died in an accident.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "He was really anxious to claim that mine... but the only person in the area who knew about the Catastrophe's movements was me, employed by Maize Drill.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So he knew nothing about the Catastrophe situation. And I happened to be a Catastrophe Messenger. The rest, as they say, is history.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Huh? So you led him into a Catastrophe area?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "What? No! I would never! I'm a professional too, I've got standards!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "I see...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "You were the sole authority on Catastrophes present. So you faked one?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "H-Hey, how did you guess my genius plan?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "But how do you fake a Catastrophe?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "The explosion. Leonhardt used Originium Arts to cause explosions, then told Cowell that the tremors were caused by a Catastrophe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Exactly! I was observing the rock formations in the mine while surveying, in order to identify locations where I could create an explosion without compromising the structural stability. And...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "There was one more important point.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "...What was it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "The explosives.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Ah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Now this is getting a little interesting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Cowell may not have felt threatened by the aftershocks of a Catastrophe on their own. He knew, however, that there were explosives set up all around the mine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "B-But what about the workers? Weren't they scared? Didn't they want to flee with you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "The lives of Rim Billiton's miners are threatened by much more than a mere Catastrophe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Compared to becoming chips... or rather, expendable fodder in the competition between mining companies...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Staying behind was the better option.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Now I understand... I suppose that's one way to 'rescue' them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Yup, the miners would be safe, as long as Cowell and his men were gone from the mine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Cowell thought he could hold them hostage as long as he still had the detonation button.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Little did he know that I had already defused the explosives!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "W-What's going on?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Is it a Catastrophe? Leonhardt?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "No, I did it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Look at Cowell's men panic.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "I'm guessing they'll be looking for me to take them somewhere safe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "But a commotion like that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Trust me. I need you guys to help out too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Once Cowell's men take me away, gather the others and make sure they don't leave this area.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Tell them it's part of the Catastrophe Messenger's plans.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "Catastrophe Messenger! The boss is looking for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "See? What did I tell you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mine Guard",
      "text": "Move it! Now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Leo—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "Leonhardt!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hm? What is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Miner",
      "text": "We'll see each other again, won't we?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Of course!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "We'll see each other again, safe and sound!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "And so the brave Catastrophe Messenger lured the villains away from the shelter he had prepared for the miners, and stood alone, steadfast, against Cowell's terrifying fangs...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Alone?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "...The brave Catastrophe Messenger, and his trusty bodyguard.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "The guards would've beat you to a pulp if I hadn't arrived when I did.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Come on, I could've dealt with a few grunts on my own.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Now, I'll grant you that things wouldn't have gone so well if that bodyguard of Cowell's was around... Indeed, they could've gone very, very badly for me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Yup.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Zzz....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Istina",
      "text": "Zzz....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Honeyberry",
      "text": "Zzz....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hey, they've all fallen asleep!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Ha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Don't laugh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "I was wondering why you sat here listening to me, when you've already heard the story a dozen times.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Now I get it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "You were waiting to laugh at me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "The story is different each time you tell it. I've lost track of how many embellishments you've made.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "You're depicting Cowell as an evil but stupid comedic villain, in order to give the impression that you're making a noble sacrifice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Well, I can't exactly get into the gory details, can I?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "It's enough that they know he's a really, really bad guy, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Yup.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "No matter which version you tell, though, it always ends with me saving the day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Feeling a little verbose today, aren't you, Ayers?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "Leon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "It's okay to make someone worry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "There are some things you don't need to hide.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Hehe...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Incidentally, Cowell's obituary appeared in the papers not long after that incident.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "At first, I was pissed that he got away, but I guess karma caught up to him in the end.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "So, Ayers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ayerscarpe",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leonhardt",
      "text": "Do you REALLY not know anything about how Cowell died?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
